    "body": "I’m personally in favor of solution A.\r\n\r\nAlso, to explain the “it’s a hack” cons. These hacks might look OK for folks with web background (including myself), but, in my experience, they’re a part of “death by thousand cuts” for non-web developers. That’s why I prioritize this. It’s not cool to have conversations like “How do I do this _[basic stuff]_?” – “Oh, there’s no proper solution for this, use one of these hacks depending on your requirements” – “Uh, okay.”",
